{{Quote|Lasers call for Chromastone!|Ben before his failed attempt to turn into Chromastone.<ref>''[[Perplexahedron (Episode)|Perplexahedron]]''</ref>}}
Chromastone has the ability to produce rainbow-colored energy from inside his body. He can then expel it out as powerful beams from either his hands,<ref name="AND">''[[A New Dawn]]''</ref> the shards on his body,<ref>''[[Voided]]''</ref> or his eye,<ref name="VoVP2"/> but only to a limited extent, as he will eventually run out of energy until he absorbs more.<ref name="TUEP2" /> Chromastone's beams are powerful enough to melt through a truck trailer<ref name="IM">''[[Inside Man]]''</ref> and destroy an entire turret.<ref name="Unearthed" /> Chromastone also has dynakinesis, allowing him to control the direction of his energy with extreme precision, as shown when he created a ring of energy that formed into several small scattering beams.<ref name="Unearthed">''[[Unearthed]]''</ref> Chromastone can also use his energy to corrupt and manipulate external sources of energy, such as [[manna]]; as seen when he dissipated a bubble of manna that [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]] had generated around him.<ref name="AP1">''[[Absolute Power: Part 1]]''</ref>

Chromastone has the ability to allow nearly any kind of energy, including lasers; electricity; manna;<ref name="VoVP2"/><ref name="TUEP2">''[[The Ultimate Enemy: Part 2]]''</ref> and any type of electromagnetic radiation,{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/3/38/AF_Mini_Bible.pdf Alien Force Series Mini Bible]|group = AF Mini Bible|name = bible}}{{Refn|[[:File:Chromastone Can Absorb Radiation.png]]|group = MW}} from ultraviolet light to cosmic rays,{{Refn|group = Bandai|name = card}} to collect within or phase through his body without harm; which he can then convert into his rainbow energy. Absorbing external energy will supercharge Chromastone's beams, making them more powerful depending on what was absorbed. For instance, when the [[Mapmaker]] attacked him with its powerful energy blast, he absorbed it and subdued the Mapmaker with an equally powerful wave of energy.<ref name="B-K">''[[Be-Knighted]]''</ref> Similarly, when [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]] gave Chromastone a large amount of manna for him to absorb, he was able to shoot powerful energy blasts to damage [[Dagon]].<ref name="TUEP2" />

Chromastone is able to redirect energy attacks instead of absorbing them.<ref name="TG">''[[The Gauntlet]]''</ref>

As well as being resistant to electricity, Chromastone can also conduct it back at the attacker, as seen when [[Lucy]] attacked him with an electric cable.<ref name="ATG" />

Chromastone is capable of instant levitation<ref name="TUEP2" /> and flight.<ref name="TCfB">''[[The Creature From Beyond]]''</ref> While flying, he can leave behind an energy trail in the air.<ref name="EoMF">''[[Enemy of My Frenemy]]''</ref>

Chromastone is capable of trapping enemies in crystals through his energy beams.<ref name="TSoC" />

Chromastone possesses enhanced strength, allowing him to overpower strong opponents, such as a [[Techadon Robot|Techadon]]-enhanced [[Cash Murray (Classic)|Cash]], with his bare hands.<ref name="TG" /> Technically speaking, he is physically stronger than [[Methanosian]]s, but weaker than [[Vaxasaurian (Classic)|Vaxasaurians]].{{Refn|[[:File:Omnitrix Transformation Duration.PNG]]|group = DM|name = link}}

Chromastone possesses enhanced durability thanks to his very dense and crystalline skin,{{Refn|[[:File:Chromastone IHT Card Number 21.png]]|group = Bandai}} which allows him to withstand being thrown against several vehicles at once.<ref name="TG" />

Chromastone is capable of jumping exceptionally high.<ref name="DR">''[[Darkstar Rising]]''</ref><ref name="VoVP2" /> He is also quite agile and fast.<ref name="GCBC">''[[Good Copy, Bad Copy]]''</ref>

Chromastone can survive in the vacuum of space, as demonstrated by [[Sugilite]] when he was traveling to what was left of [[Petropia (Classic)|Petropia]].<ref name="TSoC" />

Due to him being made of super dense silicon-based crystals, Chromastone is immune to possession from a [[Xenocite]].<ref name="IM" />

Chromastone is resistant to intense heat, as seen when Chromastone resisted the Mapmaker's energy breath.<ref name="B-K" />

Chromastone has the power to generate focused gamma rays.{{Refn|group = AF Mini Bible|name = bible}}

Chromastone can project a beam of light from his hands for illumination purposes.<ref name="IM" />

Chromastone can use his energy to increase the temperature of his body, to the point where he can become hot enough to dissolve an [[Arachnachimp (Classic)|Arachnachimp]]'s webs.<ref name="GCBC" />

If a big enough light source were to shine through him, Chromastone can create a big, beautiful rainbow in the sky.{{Refn|[[:File:Chromastone Rainbow Generation.png]]|group = DJW}}

