==Weaknesses==
<gallery type="slideshow">
AND (432).png|Absorption Incapacity
EoMF (309).png|Absorption Limit
Fame (389).png|Electricity Conductivity Limit
</gallery>
Chromastone is incapable of absorbing certain types of energy, such as the energy of the extradimensional field that protects the [[Contumelia]] from the [[Annihilarrgh]].<ref name="AND"/>

Chromastone has a limit to how much energy he can absorb at once, as he once tried to absorb all the [[manna]] from the [[Sorcerer's Engine]] but was overwhelmed to the point of disintegration.<ref name="EoMF" /> Chromastone also can have trouble absorbing and conducting electricity if the rate is too high.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/c/cf/Fame_Script_As_Recorded.pdf ''Fame'' Script As Recorded]|group = script|name = record}}<ref>''[[Fame]]''</ref>

In addition to Chromastone having a limit to how much he can absorb, he also cannot absorb the energy released by an Annihilarrgh because he would be instantly disintegrated if he tried.{{Refn|[[:File:Chromastone Cannot Absorb Big Bag.png]]|group = DJW}}

Chromastone can be controlled by [[Vladat]]s via their [[Corruptura]]s.{{Refn|[[:File:Corruptura Crystalline Entity.PNG]]|group = DJW}}

==History==
===Alien Force===
*Chromastone first appeared in ''[[All That Glitters]]'', where he defeated a zombified [[Lucy]].
*In ''[[Be-Knighted]]'', Chromastone fought the [[Mapmaker]] and realized it was trying to talk.
*In ''[[The Gauntlet]]'', Chromastone battled a [[Techadon Robot|Techadon]]-enhanced [[Cash Murray (Classic)|Cash]] until the latter broke free from the Techadon glove's negative influence.
**The same scene reoccurred twice on TV during [[Will Harangue]]'s news report in ''[[Fame]]''.
*In ''[[Paradox]]'', Chromastone prepared to fight the [[Hugo|Trans-Dimensional Creature]], but it escaped before he could do so.
*In ''[[Darkstar Rising]]'', Chromastone prepared to battle a group of [[Forever Knights]] before discovering that they were just holograms created by [[Prior Gahlil]].
*In ''[[Good Copy, Bad Copy]]'', Chromastone tried to fight [[Albedo|Negative]] [[Spidermonkey (Classic)|Spidermonkey]], but immediately reverted before he could do so.
*In ''[[Birds of a Feather]]'', Chromastone saved [[Simian]] and retrieved the crystal that the latter had failed to get.
*In ''[[Unearthed]]'', Chromastone battled some [[DNAlien]]s and destroyed their laser turret, saving [[Tiny]] in the process.
*In ''[[Voided]]'', Chromastone defeated some [[Null Guardian]]s and briefly battled [[Dr. Animo (Classic)|D'Void]] before he reverted.
*In ''[[Inside Man]]'', Chromastone burnt into a truck and fought some DNAliens.
*In ''[[Vengeance of Vilgax: Part 2]]'', Chromastone escaped the Omnitrix and battled [[Upchuck|Murk Upchuck]] until he was knocked out by [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]], prompting Murk Upchuck to recapture Chromastone. Later, Chromastone fought [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]] but was defeated and got shattered. As his remains reformed into [[Diamondhead (Classic)|Diamondhead]], remnants of Chromastone's DNA were fused with Diamondhead's, indirectly removing Chromastone from the Omnitrix.
*In ''[[The Secret of Chromastone]]'', [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] regained Chromastone.

===Ultimate Alien===
*In ''[[Fame]]'', Chromastone was defeated by [[Bivalvan]].
*In ''[[Where the Magic Happens]]'', Chromastone battled some [[Scrutin]]s.
*In ''[[Absolute Power: Part 1]]'', Chromastone was defeated by [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]] who used a [[Spells (Classic)|spell]] to melt him, so he switched into [[Terraspin]].
*In ''[[The Big Story]]'', Chromastone was used by a [[Plant Clone Ben|Plant Clone of Ben]] to fight the real Ben and [[Alien Force|his team]].
*In ''[[Viktor: The Spoils]]'', Chromastone briefly appeared when [[King Xarion]] was looking through the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] for [[Ampfibian (Classic)|Ampfibian]].
*In ''[[The Creature From Beyond]]'', Chromastone searched for the [[Lucubra]].
*In ''[[Ben 10-Generator Rex: Heroes United|Ben 10/Generator Rex: Heroes United]]'', Chromastone appeared as one of the many aliens when Ben was explaining his story to [[Rex Salazar (Generator Rex)|Rex]].
*In ''[[Enemy of My Frenemy]]'', Chromastone attempted to absorb the source of energy in [[Charmcaster (Classic)|Charmcaster]]'s machine only to be overwhelmed and forcibly reverted instead.
* In ''[[The Ultimate Enemy: Part 2]]'', Chromastone stopped [[Dagon]] from killing [[Sir George]], but was eventually defeated by the former.

===Omniverse===
*In ''[[Trouble Helix]]'', Chromastone allowed [[Blukic]] and [[Driba]] to test their new weapon on him.
*In ''[[A New Dawn]]'', Chromastone broke through the extradimensional field of the [[Contumelia]]'s machine by using a sword provided by [[Skurd]], who used [[Alien X (Classic)|Alien X]]'s DNA to create it, to retrieve [[Maltruant]]'s [[Annihilarrgh]]. Later, Chromastone appeared for a short time when [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] was cycling through his aliens.

